      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The main action with a trailing arrow.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\">Save check-in<svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;min-height:54px;padding:17px 22px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:13px;background:var(--coral,#b94131);color:#fff8ef;font:600 14px \"DM Sans Variable\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms ease}.ds-primary:hover{background:var(--coral-hover,#a53529)}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--coral,#b94131);outline-offset:4px}.ds-primary:disabled{background:#ead7c8;color:#816b68;cursor:not-allowed}"
