      "description": "A flat tonal group for the day\u2019s rhythm and saved moments.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2>Your daily rhythm</h2><p>Three little pauses to start.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{padding:21px 24px 28px;border-radius:22px;background:var(--surface,#fbe9dc);color:var(--ink,#3e2248);font-family:\"DM Sans Variable\",sans-serif}.ds-panel h2{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-panel p{margin:0;color:var(--muted,#7a626d);font-size:12px;line-height:1.65}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mood choice",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "A labeled native radio with an expressive face.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-mood\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"ds-mood\" checked aria-label=\"Good\"><svg width=\"78\" height=\"78\" viewBox=\"0 0 56 56\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"28\" r=\"26\" fill=\"#c2d7ad\"/><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 20v3m16-3v3M18 29Q28 40 38 29\"/></g></svg><span>Good</span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-mood{position:relative;display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:8px 8px 13px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:52px 52px 17px 17px;color:var(--ink,#3e2248);font:13px \"DM Sans Variable\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-mood input{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;clip-path:inset(50%)}.ds-mood svg{display:block;margin-bottom:13px}.ds-mood:has(:checked){border-color:var(--ink,#3e2248);background:var(--surface,#fbe9dc)}.ds-mood:hover{background:#f8e9de}.ds-mood:has(:focus-visible){outline:3px solid var(--coral,#b94131);outline-offset:4px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Little moments",
    "overview": "Warm peach ground, plum ink and navigation, coral actions, and five expressive mood faces make daily check-ins approachable. Bricolage Grotesque gives the headings a distinct voice; DM Sans keeps forms, labels, and saved entries clear.\n\nThe interface uses soft edges and crisp, flat color fields. Faces carry the expression, with a short settling motion when selected. Desktop has a persistent plum rail; mobile brings the same destinations into a fixed bottom navigation.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm peach ground with plum text and desktop navigation.",
      "Coral primary actions and visible keyboard focus.",
      "Five colored faces paired with written mood labels.",
      "Rounded fields, pill reasons, and flat tonal panels.",
      "Responsive navigation and reduced-motion support."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Labeled Feeling Rule",
        "body": "Always pair an interactive mood face with its written label; color and facial expression do not carry the selection alone.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "Keep the existing flat treatment for forms, navigation, and panels; reserve the implemented shadow for the floating notice.",
        "section": "elevation & depth"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Reduced Motion Rule",
        "body": "Under `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`, remove animations and transitions and use automatic scroll behavior, as the current stylesheet does.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep peach surfaces, plum structure, and coral actions in their established roles.",
      "Do retain a written label and a non-color selected indicator for every mood choice.",
      "Do reuse the existing SVG faces and emblem, locally loaded typefaces, and outlined icon style.",
      "Do preserve visible keyboard focus and reduced-motion behavior across new components.",
      "Do adapt navigation and content order at the existing mobile breakpoint."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't replace mood labels or selected check markers with color alone.",
      "Don't add shadows to ordinary fields, panels, or navigation when extending the flat system.",
      "Don't animate the selected face continuously or retain its settling animation under reduced motion.",
      "Don't let fixed mobile navigation or notices cover the last actionable content."
    ]
  }
}
